ix includes in SME tests\t\n- aarch64: fix cfi directives around __libc_arm_za_disable\t\n- aarch64: tests for SME\t\n- aarch64: clear ZA state of SME before clone and clone3 syscalls\t\n- aarch64: define macro for calling __libc_arm_za_disable\t\n- aarch64: update tests for SME\t\n- aarch64: Disable ZA state of SME in setjmp and sigsetjmp\t\n- linux: Also check pkey_get for ENOSYS on tst-pkey (BZ 31996)\t\n- aarch64: Do not link conform tests with -Wl,-z,force-bti (bug 33601)\t\n- x86: fix wmemset ifunc stray \'!\' (bug 33542)\t\n- x86: Detect Intel Nova Lake Processor\t\n- x86: Detect Intel Wildcat Lake Processor</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Arjun Shankar &lt;arjun@redhat.com&gt; - 2.39-112&#9;" date="1770638400">- Set the currency symbol in Bulgarian locale to euro (RHEL-137184)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Patsy Griffin &lt;patsy@redhat.com&gt; - 2.39-113&#9;" date="1770724800">- Update locales for Croatia to use EUR as currency symbol (RHEL-140103)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Patsy Griffin &lt;patsy@redhat.com&gt; - 2.39-114&#9;" date="1771243200">- Remove default value for LD_PROFILE_OUTPUT (RHEL-142193)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Fr&#xE9;d&#xE9;ric B&#xE9;rat &lt;fberat@redhat.com&gt; - 2.39-115&#9;" date="1772107200">- Fix race condition in io/tst-stat (RHEL-151711)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="DJ Delorie &lt;dj@redhat.com&gt; - 2.39-116&#9;" date="1772539200">- Remove unneeded ld-linux .debug files (RHEL-136312)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Arjun Shankar &lt;arjun@redhat.com&gt; - 2.39-117&#9;" date="1773748800">- dlfcn: Add dlinfo request type RTLD_DI_ORIGIN_PATH (RHEL-146428)</changelog>\n</package>\n')
